    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of Fantamon, where college orientation feels more like a creature-husbandry adventure than lecture hall drudgery\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just enrolled at the famed academy of Fantamon, only to discover your first \u201cintroductory\u201d lessons involve some weird-looking creatures called Fantamon. No syllabus, no lectures\u2014just a handful of strange bottles and a professor who vanishes faster than your confidence. Now it\u2019s up to you to prove you\u2019ve got what it takes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise &amp; Train</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nurture your Fantamon from catching to raising\u2014feed them, care about them, and harvest their produce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build &amp; Craft</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build crafting stations, craft products from Fantamon\u2019s produce, and sell them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle &amp; Triumph</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept challenges from fellow trainers and locals, then unleash your Fantamon\u2019s skills in turn-based duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Discover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam vibrant campus grounds and nearby wilds, uncovering hidden Fantamon species, rare items, and secret questlines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to graduate from rookie to the Fantamon master? Enroll today and let the adventure begin!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of Fantamon, where college orientation feels more like a creature-husbandry adventure than lecture hall drudgery\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just enrolled at the famed academy of Fantamon, only to discover your first \u201cintroductory\u201d lessons involve some weird-looking creatures called Fantamon. No syllabus, no lectures\u2014just a handful of strange bottles and a professor who vanishes faster than your confidence. Now it\u2019s up to you to prove you\u2019ve got what it takes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise &amp; Train</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nurture your Fantamon from catching to raising\u2014feed them, care about them, and harvest their produce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build &amp; Craft</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build crafting stations, craft products from Fantamon\u2019s produce, and sell them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle &amp; Triumph</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept challenges from fellow trainers and locals, then unleash your Fantamon\u2019s skills in turn-based duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore &amp; Discover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam vibrant campus grounds and nearby wilds, uncovering hidden Fantamon species, rare items, and secret questlines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to graduate from rookie to the Fantamon master? Enroll today and let the adventure begin!</p>",
    "short_description": "Grow every creature! Catch, grow or raise any Fantamon, also with the helps from...your Fantamon! Be a great Fantamon tamer or farmer, collect their produce, or unleash their potential in combat! Note: No creature or Fantamon is harmed in this game.",
